			"text": "---\nid: \"camille-sol-exo1\"\nauthor: \"camille\"\ncreated_at: \"2026-03-08T20:00:00\"\nvisibility: \"public\"\ntags: [\"méthode-directe\"]\nmappings:\n  - target: \"td.pdf\"\n    position: {page:1, bbox:[0,0.3,1,1]}\n    type: \"anchor\"\nattachments:\n  - \"camille-sol-exo1-scan.pdf\"\n---\n\n# Solution Exercice 1\n\n## Approche\nMéthode directe via le théorème\nde Heine.\n\n## Rédaction\nVoir le scan joint.\n\n## Notes\n- Piège en Q2: vérifier la\n  continuité d'abord",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"seed": 594702801,
			"version": 114,
			"versionNonce": 10029865,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773139415351,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"groupIds": [],
			"originalText": "---\nid: \"camille-sol-exo1\"\nauthor: \"camille\"\ncreated_at: \"2026-03-08T20:00:00\"\nvisibility: \"public\"\ntags: [\"méthode-directe\"]\nmappings:\n  - target: \"td.pdf\"\n    position: {page:1, bbox:[0,0.3,1,1]}\n    type: \"anchor\"\nattachments:\n  - \"camille-sol-exo1-scan.pdf\"\n---\n\n# Solution Exercice 1\n\n## Approche\nMéthode directe via le théorème\nde Heine.\n\n## Rédaction\nVoir le scan joint.\n\n## Notes\n- Piège en Q2: vérifier la\n  continuité d'abord",
